":"PolarUI","createdAt":"2024-07-11T23:40:05.136Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"6699e3faad2d6ea33cf6f5da","commentBy":{"_id":"6699e2882ac2f83b81f99d66","username":"Gauge","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2024-07-19T03:50:32.445Z","lastActive":"2024-07-25T11:30:02.410Z","status":"offline","id":"6699e2882ac2f83b81f99d66","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"Can you make the UI be able to be moved around or make a buton to make it appear/disappear","createdAt":"2024-07-19T03:56:42.824Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"669a0cbb38eefe47355f91dc","commentBy":{"_id":"669a08b21315f94355baf639","username":"Dillon","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"createdAt":"2024-07-19T06:33:22.779Z","lastActive":"2024-08-04T18:53:24.966Z","status":"offline","id":"669a08b21315f94355baf639","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"text":"There is a bug that does not disable the options, such as Toggle ESP, it stays on and that gives lag. Also the \"Infinite Stamina\" should also apply to those who are not monsters. Another thing, you should add a *on to activate and deactivate the options, it would be very useful, because for example the ESP objectives stays on and gives a lot of lag.\n\nThe script is perfect, it gives you all the coins and with an autoclicker you can be afk and generate up to 18k coins. I love that script, it is what I was looking for perfectly","createdAt":"2024-07-19T06:50:35.177Z","edited":true,"likeCount":1,"liked":false,"disliked":false},{"_id":"669ac1a46573efd3b94596ea","commentBy":{"_id":"66625d103cdaf441a8c6df07","username":"Cerounno","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ed323c959c966b2db32921d8